cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Original Bitcoin Laboratory — Pre-Genesis (OBL-NOV08)"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained reconstruction of the 15 November 2008 Bitcoin pre-release source
  witness — the earliest surviving Bitcoin code, predating the launched network. One of
  the two editions of the Original Bitcoin Laboratory (the other is v0.1.0 of January
  2009). The archive is a pre-release source witness whose completeness and standalone
  buildability are treated as unproven and are what this work sets out to establish.
  A research and teaching instrument, not money. Experimental; findings are provisional.
type: software
